Title: The Last Signal
Credit: A Cine Toaster demo production

INT. LISTENING STATION - NIGHT

MARA VALE watches the last telemetry packets arrive from Earth.

MARA
Come on. Say something.

The carrier wave disappears. Beneath the static, a second pattern begins.

EXT. ANTENNA FIELD - PRE-DAWN

Mara walks toward the dishes as they turn together toward empty sky.
